## Phase 2b Lever A: sampled-probe oracle + A3-lite gate relaxation (2026-07-11)

### A1 diagnostic (decision-point capture, 6 bad queries)
Debug-build candidate dump on 9c/11d/18a/26c/30c/31a. Findings:
