- 26c/30c iter1 cc-group: est 40.8 → actual 61,559/17,018 (1509×/417×).
- ALL five loss queries terminate with a fanout-rejected big×temp pair
  (cast_info or movie_keyword × final temp). Four (18a/30c/11d/31a) end
